ago and I was tempted to do a super quick sketch.=20

I tried out watercolour pencils for the first time, and idk if I used em ri=
ght, but I thoroughly enjoyed it. It's the perfect marriage of my two favou=
rite mediums: watercolours and colour pencils. I used a white gelly roll pe=
n and a brush pen for the highlights. I actually used the pigma brushpen fo=
r the first time and loved it. Okay, the only thing I can compare it agains=
t are the faber castell brush pens. I think each has it's own use case, but=
 I found the pigma pen to have a richer black and stronger stroke.=20

