 . . . you get the idea.
2) Pick a colour. The caricatures you see here are in yellow. (In case you =
were wondering)
3) I=E2=80=99ll make you a digital caricature. I can design and mail you a =
printed card as well (once we=E2=80=99re past the lockdown). 4) I am collec=
ting 600 bucks per caricature. This might sound overpriced but I believe it=
=E2=80=99s a reasonable denomination for donating. You are always welcometo=
 pitch in more :) 5) Every buck that is collected will go to an NGO working=
 in Chennai. 600 rupees roughly translates to 3kg rice, 1.5 kg dal and a re=
asonable amount of other basic supplies. Check the link in bio for details.
6) I see myself doing at least one caricature everyday for the rest of the =
lockdown so I will take the first requests that come in.

